  "details": "Yesterday it happend totally randomly and after me and my friends spend at least over 2-3hours in a world. \nFirst everyone who was in the world with me from begin with, literaly froze after 2hrs and i only was able to see the hands doing gestures. At the same time new people who joined the World, got stuck at spawn and werent able to move away. ( for me and my friends, people who joined in told me they were fine and moved around ) \nAfter rejoining the World, everyone got stuck at the spawn for me who was still in the world. I was able to move around, but my friends saw me being stuck. Even after relogging i was still stuck at the spawn for my friends. We all had to relog to fix this issue. It wasnt the first time this happend.\n\nhttps://ibb.co/93rHqS9",
